 year olds in a city with a lot of club-size rooms.","affinity":0.927,"venue":{"name":"Sample place 1 (Baltimore)","why":"Top crowd match (0.90) with moderate popularity (0.37). Place 2 matches nearly as well but is much busier (0.94).","alternates":["Sample place 4 (Baltimore)","Sample place 2 (Baltimore)"]},"openers":[{"name":"Hovvdy","why":"Affinity 0.89 in Baltimore."},{"name":"Florist","why":"Affinity 0.71. Same act as the Suffolk date, so you could keep one support act for both."}],"promo":{"angle":"Weeknight club show. Lead with the 25-29 crowd (+0.34) through local bars and podcasts.","partners":["Sample brand 1 (Baltimore)","Sample podcast 1 (Baltimore)"],"copy":"Baltimore, first time headlining your town. Small room, loud set. Come early."},"driveHoursFromPrev":4.2,"date":"2027-03-04","weekday":"Thu","evidence":{"tasteRank":27,"of":109,"metroPop":1342884,"opportunity":0.06,"venueAffinity":0.9}},{"city":"Philadelphia, PA","lat":39.9524,"lon":-75.1636,"why":"Affinity 0.984 (rank 0.994), the best routable metro on this run. 3.35M people, opportunity +0.07. Probably your Saturday.","affinity":0.984,"venue":{"name":"Sample place 1 (Philadelphia)","why":"Affinity 0.90 at popularity 0.27, so the crowd fits without paying for a big-name room.","alternates":["Sample place 2 (Philadelphia)","Sample place 3 (Philadelphia)"]},"openers":[{"name":"Hand Habits","why":"Highest opener over-index in Philly (0.95)."},{"name":"Florist","why":"Affinity 0.83 here. Option to keep the same support from Suffolk through Philly."}],"promo":{"angle":"The anchor date of the run. Get the announcement out early because Philly sells late but sells.","partners":["Sample brand 1 (Philadelphia)","Sample podcast 1 (Philadelphia)","Sample place 2 (Philadelphia)"],"copy":"Philly is the big one this run. Bring your friends. Tickets on sale now."},"driveHoursFromPrev":2.1,"date":"2027-03-05","weekday":"Fri","evidence":{"tasteRank":5,"of":109,"metroPop":3349673,"opportunity":0.07,"venueAffinity":